1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:05,363
Writing a story with a big cast? Here's
how to check one character at a time.

2
00:00:05,613 --> 00:00:09,623
Put your whole world on one timeline,
counted in your own calendar.

3
00:00:09,673 --> 00:00:11,981
Here, years after the Reckoning.

4
00:00:12,301 --> 00:00:16,491
Separate by tags, choose Mirelle, and her
whole story lifts into its own track:

5
00:00:16,541 --> 00:00:19,286
born at sea, the voyage,
the map, the escape.

6
00:00:19,366 --> 00:00:23,796
Need her a year later? Shift
everything tagged Mirelle at once.

7
00:00:23,846 --> 00:00:25,777
One Undo puts it back.

8
00:00:26,047 --> 00:00:29,717
Your work stays private until you
share it. It's OpenChronology,

9
00:00:29,767 --> 00:00:31,111
and it's free.
